  "description": "YITAMOTOR cargo liners are made with non-toxic and odorless TPE material, 2017-2021 Honda Civic Sedan, with vinyl floors.\nFitment\n2016-2021 Honda Civic Sedan\n(Not fit Hatchback or 2 Door Model)\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR Cargo Liners are fit for 2016-2021 Honda Civic Sedan, with vinyl floors. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the back.\nSafe & Durable: YITAMOTOR Cargo Trunk Liner are made with odorless TPE material, safety even in extreme hot weather. The product contains cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC’s. High tensity TPE material not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, but also remains flexible in even the harshest of cold weather.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the mats from slipping. The mats are available for the elderly.\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
